WEBVTT

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.151
so I do it.

00:04:31.175 --> 00:04:32.177
(Laughter)

00:04:32.201 --> 00:04:36.092
When I was about 21, an astrologer told me

00:04:36.116 --> 00:04:38.271
that I was going to meet
the man of my dreams,

00:04:38.295 --> 00:04:40.711
and that his name was going
to be Eric, right?

00:04:40.735 --> 00:04:43.229
So, you know, for years I would go to bars

00:04:43.253 --> 00:04:45.488
and, sort of, anyone I met
whose name was Eric,

00:04:45.512 --> 00:04:47.583
I was humping immediately or something.

00:04:47.607 --> 00:04:49.912
(Laughter)

00:04:49.936 --> 00:04:51.902
There were times when I was so desperate,

00:04:51.926 --> 00:04:54.029
I would just walk into a room
and go, "Eric?"

00:04:54.053 --> 00:04:56.999
And anybody who would turn around,
I would make a beeline for.

00:04:57.023 --> 00:04:58.114
(Laughter)

00:04:58.138 --> 00:05:01.370
And I had this really interesting
tarot reading a long time ago.